<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.3 Ablation Studies ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ HAM: Hierarchical Adapters Merging for Scalable Continual Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Impact of the Number of Groups</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In 4.3 Ablation Studies ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ HAM: Hierarchical Adapters Merging for Scalable Continual Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Impact of the Merging Algorithm</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px5" title="In 4.3 Ablation Studies ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ HAM: Hierarchical Adapters Merging for Scalable Continual Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Impact of Pruning</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
